{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31957","headline":"落第东归逢僧伯阳 · 贾岛","name":"落第东归逢僧伯阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相逢须语笑，人世别离频。\n晓至长侵月，思乡动隔春。\n见僧心暂静，从俗事多迍。\n宇宙诗名小，山河客路新。\n翠桐犹入爨，清镜未辞尘。\n逸足思奔骥，随羣且退鳞。\n宴乖红杏寺，愁在绿杨津。\n老病难爲乐，开眉赖故人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}